# Repository-wide ignores. backend/ and frontend/ keep their own .gitignore files too.

### Claude Code (local launch config, settings) ###
.claude/

### Build output and dependencies ###
target/
dist/
node_modules/

### IDEs and editors ###
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vscode/
*.swp

### OS files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### Logs ###
*.log
npm-debug.log*

### Local environment / secrets ###
.env
.env.*
*.local
